<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Omnia returns to profit at half year.</title>
<headline>Omnia returns to profit at half year.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	  0.9	   vs   15.8 loss</p>
<p>    Net income		   0.37	  vs   6.11 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-associates  0.64 loss   vs   7.14 loss</p>
<p>    Tax			     -	    vs    -</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     17.42	  vs   12.86</p>
<p>    Turnover		   358.48	  vs   280.57</p>
<p>    Share of associates'     1.41	  vs   1.03</p>
<p>Full name: Omnia Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the interim dividend would be considered by the board in November.</p>
<p>Omnia said results had been helped by a buoyant fertiliser market.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
